  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Telekinesis sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> By forming a thin field of telekinetic force with your hand as a swift action you can gain a +2 shield bonus to your armor class, +1 per 5 caster levels in Telekinesis. This counts as a shield, except it imposes no spell failure or armor check penalty. You must keep at least one hand free to maintain your force shield.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/protokinesis-feats#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
